  "conformsTo": "http://mlcommons.org/croissant/1.0",
  "name": "CrossMEP",
  "description": "Tiered synthetic dataset of multi-trade MEP cross-sections for learning-based structural support assembly synthesis. 7,000 contexts per data revision across train/val/test/benchmark splits on disjoint seeds; tiers C1-C8 by exact element count; deliberately unlabeled (supervision from downstream environment rules). Data revision 4.1 (current; composition adjusted after the comparison with two open buildings, DN bands to DN150), 4.0 and 3.0 (the CIB W78 2026 paper release); release 4.1.0.",
  "version": "4.1.0",
  "datePublished": "2026-10-03",
  "license": "https://creativecommons.org/licenses/by/4.0/",
  "url": "https://github.com/lavinia-ped/CrossMEP_Dataset",
  "citeAs": "Pedrollo, L., Gvadzabia, D., Graeber, T. & Fischer, M. (2026). CrossMEP: A Tiered Synthetic Dataset of Multi-Trade MEP Cross-Sections. 43rd International CIB W78 Conference, New Delhi.",
